  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4971c5eb32d68c6419c2b82ec69e3fa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: ConvoStareTwo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: ConvoStareTwo
  dialogueLines:
  - The player has been listening to these workers for a very long time. This is
    becoming uncomfortable.
  - The player is still listening to the workers. The narrator is beginning to feel
    rather uneasy about this.
  - The worker has noticed the snooping. Perhaps the player should go somewhere else.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t stopped listening once. This is starting to get a little
    unsettling."
  - The player continues to eavesdrop. The narrator is beginning to question their
    intentions.
  - "That\u2019s quite enough snooping. Even the narrator is starting to feel uncomfortable."
  - "The workers are trying to discuss secret things, but the player continues to
    listen. Perhaps that\u2019s enough."
  - The player has been listening for an uncomfortable amount of time. Maybe go away
    now.
  - Still listening. The narrator is starting to think this has gone beyond simple
    curiosity.
  - The player continues to listen to the workers in silence. The narrator would
    really prefer they stopped.
  canRepeat: 1
